[ti:Mala Ved Laagale (Duet)]
[ar:Swapnil Bandodkar & Ketakee Mateygaonkar]
[by:Mornye (source: Zarz-LRC)]

[00:39.405]v1:Rang baawarya swapnaana saanga re saanga
[00:49.355]v1:Kund kalyaana, welinaa saanga re saanga
[00:58.855]v2:He bhaas hoti kase
[01:02.105]v2:He naaw othi kunaache
[01:05.375]v2:Ka saang wedya mana
[01:08.705]v2:Mala bhaan nahi jagaache
[01:15.255]v2:Mala wed laagale premaache
[01:21.709]v1:Mala wed laagale premaache
[01:28.509]v2:Premaache, premaache
[02:01.205]v1:Naadaawale, dhundaawale
[02:04.609]v1:Kadhi guntale man baawale
[02:07.909]v1:Na kale kase konaamule
[02:11.009]v1:Sur laagale man mokale
[02:14.558]v2:Ha bhaas ki tujhi aahe nasha
[02:20.909]v2:Mala saad ghaalati daahi disha
[02:27.601]v2:Mala wed laagale premaache
[02:34.20]v2:Mala wed laagale premaache
[02:40.759]v2:Premaache, premaache
[03:26.752]v1:Jagane nawe waate mala
[03:30.009]v1:Kuni bhetala maajha mala
[03:33.409]v1:Khulata kali umalun ha
[03:36.609]v1:Man mogara gandhaalala
[03:39.906]v2:Ha bhaas ki tujhi aahe nasha
[03:46.579]v2:Mala saad ghaalati daahi disha
[03:53.059]v1:Mala wed laagale premaache
[03:59.719]v2:Mala wed laagale premaache
[04:06.159]v2:Premaache, premaache
